00:01:50.498 --> 00:01:51.932
AND WHAT YOU SEE RIGHT NOW IS

00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:54.401
NOT FROM THE CARAVAN, BUT TAKE A

00:01:54.402 --> 00:01:55.869
